Python Calculator

My first Python calculator project.

Description

A simple command-line calculator built with Python. It uses functions imported from a separate module.

Features

Addition

Subtraction

Multiplication

Division

Decimal number support using float()

Repeat calculations using a while loop

Division-by-zero handling

Project Structure

calculator.py – Main calculator program

Omale.py – Contains the arithmetic functions

Technologies

Python 3

What I Learned

Functions and modules

Importing functions

Conditional statements

While loops

Input conversion using float()

Indentation and program structure
